    <worksheet name='Profit/Cost/Sales Line Chart'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f'>Total &lt;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f'>[Parameters].[Parameter 1]</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f'>&gt; by Year: Jonathan Williams</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Chart Type: Line Chart
Dual Axis: N
Reference Line: N
Trend Line: Y
Calculated Fields: 1 (Select Your Metric)
Table Calculations: 0
LOD Calculations: 0
Mark Cards: 0
Filters: 0
Visualization: This line chart enables users to visualize the fluctuations in cost, profit, and sales over the past three years, allowing them to discern the overall trend across these metrics.

Analysis: From these three graphs, we can observe seasonality across all of them. While two of the graphs display a negative trend, sales appears to remain relatively stable over time.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Categories Sheet+ (Regional_Sales) (2)' name='federated.04m21m90b9c0ae14dtpqc1asy8f6' />
            <datasource name='Parameters' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
            <column alias='Profit' caption='Select Your Metric' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 1]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;Profit&quot;'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Profit&quot;' />
              <aliases>
                <alias key='&quot;Cost&quot;' value='Cost' />
                <alias key='&quot;Profit&quot;' value='Profit' />
                <alias key='&quot;Sales&quot;' value='Sales' />
              </aliases>
            </column>
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.04m21m90b9c0ae14dtpqc1asy8f6'>
            <column caption='Select Your Metric' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_975029376587993090]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 1] WHEN &apos;Profit&apos; THEN sum(([UnitPrice]-[UnitCost])*[OrderQuantity])&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;Sales&apos; THEN COUNT([OrderNumber])&#13;&#10;ELSE SUM([UnitCost]*[OrderQuantity])&#13;&#10;END' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Order Date' datatype='date' name='[OrderDate]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
            <column caption='Order Number' datatype='string' name='[OrderNumber]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Order Quantity' datatype='integer' name='[OrderQuantity]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Unit Cost' datatype='real' name='[UnitCost]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Unit Price' datatype='real' name='[UnitPrice]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[OrderDate]' derivation='Month-Trunc' name='[tmn:OrderDate:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_975029376587993090]' derivation='User' name='[usr:Calculation_975029376587993090:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
