Table Calculations: 0
LOD Calculations: 4 (Category Fixed Unit Cost, Category Fixed Unit Profit, Total Average Unit Cost, Total Average Unit Profit)
Mark Cards: 4
Filters: 1
Visualization: I decided to label the quadrants to draw attention to specific categories performing well or poorly. Additionally, I labeled each category point to provide immediate clarity to my audience without the need to hover over a tooltip.
Analysis: From this graph, we can observe that the majority of categories are positioned above the average cost and average profit. Interestingly, many of these categories seem to be related to technology. However, there are a few categories situated below the average cost but above the average profit, and only one category falls above the average cost but below the average profit.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
